{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":137,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܢܲܗܪ̈ܵܘܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܕܒܵܒܹܠܔ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܬܵܡܵܐ ܝܬܝܼܒ݂ ܠܲܢ، ܐܘܼܦ ܒܟܹܐ ܠܲܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܲܕ ܕܟ݂ܝܼܪܵܐ ܠܲܢ ܨܸܗܝܘܿܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܚܹܠܵܦܹ̈ܐ ܕܒܓܵܘܘܼܗ̇،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܬܠܹܐ ܠܲܢ ܟܸܢܵܪ̈ܲܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܬܵܡܵܐ ܠܲܒܠܵܢܲܢ̈ ܠܐܲܣܝܼܪܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܛܠܝܼܒ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܡܸܢܲܢ ܙܡܵܪ̈ܝܵܬܹ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܓ̰ܲܢܓ̰ܸܪ̈ܵܢܲܢ ܛܠܝܼܒ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܡܸܢܲܢ ܚܲܕܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ، ܒܹܐܡܵܪܵܐ:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܙܡܘܿܪܘܼܢ ܐܸܠܲܢ ܡ̣ܢ ܙܡܵܪ̈ܝܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܕܨܸܗܝܘܿܢ.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܵܐܟ݂ܝܼ ܙܵܡܪܲܚ ܙܡܵܪ̈ܝܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܢܘܼܟ݂ܪܵܝܬܵ‌ܐ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܸܢ ܢܵܫܹܢܵܟ݂ܝ، ܝܵܐ ܐܘܿܪܸܫܠܸܡ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܵܫܝܵܐ ܝܲܡܝܼܢܝܼ ܡܗܝܼܪܘܼܬܘܼܗ̇.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܵܥܹܐ ܠܸܫܵܢܝܼ ܠܫܵܡܵܟܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܸܢ ܠܵܐ ܕܵܟ݂ܪܹܢܵܟ݂ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܸܢ ܠܵܐ ܡܲܐܣܩܸܢ ܠܐܘܿܪܸܫܠܸܡ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܸܠܸܠܔ ܡ̣ܢ ܪܹܝܫܵܐ ܕܚܲܕܘܼܬ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܟ݂ܘܿܪ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܠܒܢܲܝ̈ ܐܲܕܘܿܡ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܕܓܵܠܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܐܘܿܪܸܫܠܸܡ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܐܡܝܼܪܗܘܿܢ: ”ܬܠܘܿܚܘܼܢ، ܬܠܘܿܚܘܼܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܠܔ ܫܲܬܐܸܣܬܘܼܗ̇.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܒܪܵܬ ܒܵܒܹܠܔ، ܗܕܝܼܪܬܵ‌ܐ ܠܚܪܵܒ݂ܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܘܼܒ݂ܵܐ ܠܗ̇ܘ ܕܦܵܪܹܥ ܠܵܟ݂ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܦܘܼܪܥܵܢܵܐ ܕܦܪܝܼܥ ܠܵܟ݂ܝ ܐܸܠܲܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܘܼܒ݂ܵܐ ܠܗ̇ܘ ܕܕܵܒܹܩ ܘܛܵܪܹܦ ܠܝܵܠܵܕ݇ܟ݂ܝ̈","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܩܵܝܵܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/137.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/138.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/136.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}